(168, 19, 9, '👥 **Members Added to Group**\n\n📋 **Action:** New members added to group\n👨‍💼 **Added by:** MUNMUN MAHARANA\n👥 **New Members:** Rohit Sharma\n📅 **Date:** Sep 22, 2025 at 11:57 AM\n\n🎉 Welcome the new members to the group!', NULL, NULL, 0, '2025-09-22 06:27:27', NULL),
(169, 19, 9, '👑 **New Group Leader Assigned**\n\n**MUNMUN MAHARANA** has made **Rohit Sharma** the new group leader.\n\n⚠️ **Note**: Only one member can be a group leader at a time.\n\nGroup leaders can:\n• Add/remove group members\n• Create settlements\n• Remove room admins from group\n• Manage all group activities', NULL, NULL, 0, '2025-09-22 06:27:50', NULL),
